    <string name="ui_a_persistent_notification_is_shown_and_the_cpu_stays_awake_while">"A persistent notification is shown and the CPU stays awake while connected. Allow RemoteGPT to run in the background and set its battery policy to unrestricted in system settings. If you use Tailscale, allow it to connect in the background too. The wake lock is released on disconnection.\n\nWith persistent remote sessions enabled, closing the app or losing the network does not actively stop remote tasks. Messages are restored on reconnect. Tasks awaiting approval pause until you reconnect and respond. Host restarts or process crashes can still interrupt them. On Android 11 and later, enable bubbles in notification settings. If bubbles are disabled, tap a notification to return to the conversation."</string>
